<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Ngindo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ja</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu chenje kiandikigwa na mundu jumwe jwakemigwa Yakobo. Inhotwi kube Yakobo jonjo nga ojwakiba nnuna gwa Yesu, kabe akiba kilongoi mukikuta chukutumbula cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto nu uyo akiba jumwe kati ja bandu bi libalacha likolongwa lya Yelusalemu (Itendwa 15:13). Uyo ndundame Paulo mu kitabu cha Akagalatia 2:9 ankema Yakobo, “lueke,” lu kikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto. Akachomi baamini kutenda kitabu cha Yakobo kiandikigwa tango nu kuikaje chaka cha 50 kuboka pukubelekwa Kilisto. Gambu Yakobo akiba kilongoi jukikuta cha bandu abunhwamini Kilisto chuku Yelusalemu penia inhotwi kube aandika kitabu chenje pakiba akatama kwenio.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakobo baandikila kitabu chenje, “Makabi komi na mabena agapwilikine ku ilambo yenge” (Lipungu lya 1:1). Maboulo agabi mukitabu cha Yakobo nga gakajangata bandu boa abunhwamini Kilisto nambu malobe ganga, “Makabila komi na mabena” gatenda ibonekane Yakobo baandakila Akayahudi abunhwamini Kilisto. Magambu kitabu chenje kipaligwa kichomigwe na bandu ajingi kilongile minhalo nduu. Yakobo akwajalile nhwalo gwa imani ni itendwa kutenda imani ja kweli jilaigwa ku itendwa (Lipungu lya 2:17). Uyo akelabwie nhwalo gwakakonjale bandu bina uloi (Lipungu lya 2:1-4). Kabe atulenge tuba maha kwa agatulongela (Lipungu lya 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Agabi mukitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobo bapata abali akachomi bakwe (Lipungu lya 1:1-1).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe balimbia mwojo bandu abunhwamini Kilisto kuimbalila mu kulaga (Lipungu lya 1:2-27).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe alanduli pibi kile chambone imani kulaigwa ku itendwa (Lipungu lya 2:1-26).</para>
  <para style="io">Kuboka penia alaya nhwalo gwa malobe pagabi na makakala (Lipungu lya 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe Yakobo alanduli malango ga Nnoongo pagalekine na malango ga dunia (Lipungu lya 3:13-4:10).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabe bakelebuya akachomi bakwe ku nhwalo gu kulokaloka (Lipungu lya 4:11-5:6).</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobo ajomole kitabu chakwe kukalapila ilebe nduu (Lipungu lya 5:7-20).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ne Yakobo, napakachi ba Nnoongo na Angwana ana Yesu Kilisto, nampatanga abali mangweto, mammi kabila komi na mabena, agapwilikine padunia joa!</para>
  <para style="s">Malango nu kuhyobalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Makalongo pannondoigwa mmanyanga kutenda ngi kingobu chinu chu kuala mwojo, <verse number="3" style="v"/>mmanyi kutenda kulondoigwa ku imani inu impe kuimbalila. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nno! Kuimbalila kwinu kube mpaka pukupela, kupala nkomale na nnimbe panga pelelwa kilebe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nambu anda mundu kati jinu apelwi malango gu kumanya, apaligwa kunnyopa Nnoongo ojwabape bandu boa muno nu kwambone. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu apaligwa kujopa ku imani pangapwele kilebe. Gambu mundu ojwabi na mbwele abi andi kilebe chikitoligwa na kimbonga nu kulekeligwa okwo na okwo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gambu mundu andi jwenio akahyobaleje kupoke kilebe ka Angwana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mundu juna ndela ibena kuchichilakana mundela yakwe yenie yoa.</para>
  <para style="s">Nhwocho na juna uloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Anda nnyinu mundu jwanhwamine Kilisto abi nhwocho apaligwa kuala mwojo pajinuligwa na Nnoongo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>na mundu juna uloi aalala mwojo pauluigwa na Nnoongo. Gambu mundu juna uloi apakujebelea andi liloba likamanyai. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lichoba pilipita lumu kubala nu kulembuya matutwe, na maloba gakwe kutola pae nukualaje kabe. Uyo na mundu juna uloi apakujebelea mukubegele kwakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulondoigwa nu kutegigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mbaya mundu ojwajendeke kuaminika mukulondoigwa, gambu andaimbalile mpaka kupela, aipata hupo ya bwomi eyalagila Nnoongo kapeganga abampala. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Anda mundu alondoligwe, akalengaje, “Nondoligwe na Nnoongo”, Gambu Nnoongo kunnondoyaje mundu kwa mabaja na jwenio. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu mundu alondoligwa pautigwa nu kujonjigwa na tama jakwe mbaja. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuboka penia tama mbaja anda jikomile jileta mabaja na mabaja anda gakomile galeta kiu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Makalongo bango manampala, makakoloigwaje! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Itoi yambone yoa ina kuala na tegatega iboka kumbengu, iboka Kawawa, abapangani muli kumbengu, benia kugalambukaje andi kiwili chikiama ama. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kukupala kwabe bene ngubutupotola ku lilobe lyabe lya kweli, kupala tube milembu mu yoa yapangine.</para>
  <para style="s">Kujoa nu kamula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Makalongo manampalanga nkombakelanga kilebe chenje! Kila mundu ajojakele kujoa nambu akajojokeje kulongela wala akajojoke kuchimwaje. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gambu lilaka lya mundu kuotwaje kamu gambone gapala Nnoongo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yene magalekele kutali mabaja goa nu uchapu mpokelange kukunyenyepa lilobe lya Nnoongo elyapandite umyojo jinu, lyene liotwile kunkombolanga mangweto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mikikikoloyaje mmene makangweto kukupenakia tuje lilobe lyakwe nambu mpaligwa kamula ku itendwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Anda mundu jwajoa jwapenakia lilobe lyenie nambu kulibegeleje, jwenio andi mundu ojwakilolake mulindala, <verse number="24" style="v"/>andajomwi kikilolakea nu kuboka, kulibalila pabile. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nambu mundu ojwakamu kukachana malagilo agalenganile nu kabeka bandu kube agabwa, nu kujendeke kutenda yenie pangalibalila chakijoine, nambu ngalikamula apakupata kindimba mu kila kilebe chakamula. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mundu anda akibona nga ojwang'ola Nnoongo, nambu kulutabaje lugomo lwakwe mmanya jwenio ang'ongale Nnoongoje, na akikoloya mwene. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ndela ejibi chwapi janga malemwa nnongi ja Nnoongo Awawa ngajenje, kajangata akakeba na akananhwele mumalola gabe, kikilende mmene makaakaigwaje padunia jenje.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kelebuya nhwalo gu kubagulana</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Makalongo anda maamini Ana Yesu Kilisto, Angwana bi kibumo, makabagu banduje na pachokuje. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tulenge mundu jonge akwindite pete ja jaabu na ngobo inachwapi ajingi pangongano inu, ni kingobu ucho ajingi mundu jonge ojwakwindite ngobo yangambone. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Anda munyalite muno jwajo ojwakwindite ngobo inachwapi nu kunnenge “ntame pamba” panachwapi na kunnenge nhwochojo “mwe nkajema okwo” andaje kunnenge “ntame paijagi,” <verse number="4" style="v"/>bo, kwenio kubagulanaje mangweto kwa mangweto? Bo mmi kuhukumuje mumawacho mabaja?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Makalongo bango manampala, mpenikiyange! Nnoongo bachagwi bandu akahocho padunia jenje babe bandu bina kipato mu imani nukupoke kingwana chalagila Nnoongo apakape bandu abapaile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu mangwetumwe mabembu bandu akahocho! Bo, bandu binuloi nga abamponjaje nu kumpeleka mumabalacha? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bo, nga beniaje abalitukana liina lyambone lya Kilisto, mangweto nga bakwe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Anda nnenganakie malagilo gi kingwana cha Nnoongo andi piandikigwe Mumajandiko ga Chwapi kulenga, “Mumpale nndami nnyinu andi pimikipala mmene,” mmanya mpakutenda pipaligwa muno. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nambu anda mabagwi bandu ntenda ubaja, na malagilo gunhukumulanga mangweto mmi kujalije malagilo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ojwalemwa lilagilo limwe, mmanya abakube ni lilemwa mumalagilo goa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gambu Nnoongo ujwo jwalenga makatenda “ngongolaje” nga ujwo ojwalenga, “Makakomaje.” Kuyene ata ikabi nteije ngongola, nambu nte koma, mwe magajaliteje malagilo goa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nnongelanga nukamu andi bandu abapa kuhukumigwa kwa malagilo agaleta agabwa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gambu Nnoongo abeje na kia apapakunhukumu mundu jwanga kiya. Juna kiya kujogopaje kujema nnongi ja hukumu ja Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="s">Imani ni itendwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Makalongo chambone kini anda mundu alengite akweti imani nu kongo kulayaje kuitendwa? Bo, imani jenie jiotolabo kunkola? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Anda tulonge mundu ojwaamini abi munalome andaje munkege akwetije ngobo wala chakulya. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bo kualala kunnenge jwenio, “nnyabula kwa tengela makajote mwoto nu kujukuta,” pangampe kile chakipala mubwomi gwakwe? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uyo imani janga itendwa iwile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambu mundu aotwi kulenga, “Mwenga nkweti imani, nenga ngweti itendwa!” Elo! Unangile mundu kube na imani panga itendwa, nane nannangila imani jango kuitendwa yango. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bo, mwe kuamini kutenda Nnoongo abi jumwe tu! Tela! Nimichepela jiamini ulyo, kabe nukulendema kwa mbwele. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mwe malangoje! Bo, mpala kunnaya kube imani janga itendwa jiwile? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bo, Ulaimu aokobito bapatabo kube bambone nnongi ja Nnoongo? Ikiba kuitendwa yabeje! Kingobu pabampanga mwana gwabe Isaka pikitembe kube lilumbo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mmikulola kutenda imani jakwe kengamana ni itendwa yakwe, imani jakwe jikamilika ni itendwa yakwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yene ngagalenganila Majandiko Gachwapi agalenga, “Ulaimu nganhwamini Nnoongo, na kuimani jakwe Nnoongo ngannyekete kube jwambone.” Yene Ulaimu ngakemigwa ng'anja jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mmikulola kutenda mundu ajeketeligwa kube jwambone nnoongi ja Nnoongi kuitendwa yakwe, ngiti kuimani jika tuje. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ikiba uyo kunhwalo gu munkege nngongola ojwakonda Laabu. Jwenio ngajeketeligwa kube jwambone nnongi ja Nnoongo magambu ga kapokela akaingakii Akasilaeli bajabule kupete jenge ndela. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yene andi mmele panga uhuke mmanya uwile, uyo imani yanga itendwa iwile.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuundika lulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Makalongo bango, makalokale kube makaboli ajingije. Andi umanyiela, takaboli tubakupata hukumu ngolongwa kupeta bange bandu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gambu tuboa twenga tulemwa ku ile ijingi. Anda mundu kulemwaje mukulonge kwakwe, mmanya mundu jwenio akamilike, na aotwile kukilongalea mmele gwakwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Twenga tantaba choma pakano falasi kupala atukengame kwakwoa okutupala kujenda. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nhwachanga ntumbwi, iganukube nkolongwa uotwile kuutigwa nuupepo nambu kugalambuya kwa kasia njokochoko, kujenda kwakwoa okwapala jwaulongalea. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Uyo, lulimi, luganukube kipagwa kichokochoko cha mmele, kukiluya makolongwa muno.</para>
  <para style="p">Mwoto nchokochoko tu nambu uotwile kutinia nhwitu nkolongwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lulimi lubi andi mwoto. Lutweli mabaja ndu ngi kipagwa kichokochoko chi mibele jito nambu kujambuki ubaja mmele gwoa. Lulimi kutinia bwomi gwito gwoa kuboke kubelekwa mpaka kuwe. Gambu gwene utiniigwa na mwoto gu kujahanamu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mundu aotwile kulanga inyama naotwile kulanga ipanganigwe yoa andi inyama ya mpongote ni ijuni ni ikokalakani na yamaki yu umache. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambu kila mangobu nimi ito kutulema. Lulimi kilebe kibaja, kutawalikaje, kabe kitweli uchungu ogukoma bandu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ku lulimi twenga tutenda kalumba Angwana na Awawa bito. Kululimi ulwo tabeka nhwilo bandu, bandu abapanganigwe kukilandanikio cha Nnoongo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Malobe gukumpe mundu kindimba na gukummeka mundu nhwilo goa gaboka mukano jimwe. Makalongo bango, ilebe yenje ipaligwije kube yene. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Chembwe chimwe kupiaje mache maimu na gina mwinyo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Makalongo bo, ntini uotwile kupambika zabibu? Andaje nzabibu kupambika tini? Chembwe cha mache gina mwinyo kupiaje mache maimu.</para>
  <para style="s">Malango kuboka ku Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bo, mene juna kumanya na malango kati jinu? Alaye kilebe chenie kwa majendo gakwe gambone ni itendwa yakwe eitendigwa ina kualala itendigwa kukunyenyepa na kwa malango. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nambu anda myojo jinu jitweli bwiu nu kuchimwa nu kukikoya, makaibilikije kweli kukulokeloke gwambone gwinu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Malango genia gaboka kumbenguje, nambu ja padunia ngiti ji Uhuke jwa Chwapije, kabe gu Kichetani. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gambu papoa apabi bwiu na kukiluya, penia pabi ni kijonga na kila ubaja. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nambu malango agaboke kumbengu, gabi chwapi, kupala tengela nu kulita na kajali bandu, utweli kia na itendwa yambone, kubagulanaje wala undendemunduje. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bandu abapala tengela bapandanga mbeju ya tengela na bapakuuna mauno agunhwalali Nnoongo.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Kummandaki Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuputana nu kujomana kuboka ko? Kuboka mutama inu eijomana nkati jinu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mmi na tama ju kupala ilebe nambu mmi kipataje yene nnolanga tela tu koma, yene mmi kujomana nu kuputana. Mpatangaje chimikipala magambu mmi kujopaje ku Nnoongo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pannyopanga ku Nnoongo mmi kupataje magambu nnyopanga ilebe kupala mitumie ku tama inu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mangwetumwe mabandu bangaaminika. Bo, mmanyije kutenda kipala ilebe ya dunia tela nu kube mangondwa ba Nnoongo? Mundu jwajoa ojwaipala ilebe ya dunia abe nngondwa jwa Nnoongo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Makapemeleje kutenda Majandiko Gachwapi galenga malobe gajagi, pagalenga, “Uhuke ojwabekigwe na Nnoongo nkati jito abi na bwiu muno.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nambu upeele gwatupi Nnoongo guna makakala muno, andi Majandiko pagalenga, “Nnoongo kakananga bandu bina kulokaloka nambu kapeganga kindimba bandu abanyenyepa.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lele mannyali Nnoongo, mankanange Mmaja na jwenio mantilanga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mummandakile Nnoongo jwombe maba papipi na mangweto. Nkuyange maboko ginu makabajamwe. Nnyeguyange myojo jinu makandendemundu! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nhwechukange na ng'utange nukokaleka. Kueka kwinu kube nguto, nu kuala mwojo kwinu kube kuwechuka kukolongwa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nnyenyepange nnongi ja Angwana, bombe mabanyinulanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Kelebuya nhwalo gwakahukumu ajinu akaumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Makalongo makakopekeanaje, ojwankopake nnongo gwakwe andaje kunhukumu nnongo gwakwe, agakopake malagilo nu kugahukumu malagilo. Nambu anda magahukumu malagilo mmanya mwe mmi kugaagabalaje malagilo, nambu mmi mahakimu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nnoongo tu ojwaotwi kubeka malagilo nu kugahukumu. Jwenio jikajakwe ojwaotwi kombola nukujita bandu. Lele mwe mabene mpaka nhwoto kahukumu ajinu bandu?</para>
  <para style="s">Kelebuya nhwalo gu kulokaloka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngoe mpenikiyange mangweto mannenga kutenda, “Leleno andaje malabo nijenda kilambo chikuteno nukutama kwenio chaka mbyu kuucha ilebe nu kupata uloi ndu.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mangwetomwe mmanyije bwomi gwinu apupakube malabo! Bwomi gwinu nga nike, mangweto mmi andi ngongobwe ijipiti kingobu tu nukuboka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ipaligwa kulenga “Angwana anda bapaile tuba tammomi tutenda chache na chache.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nambu ngoe ntenda kulokaloka nu kukiluya, kulokaloka kwenio kubaja. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Anda mundu kamwaje lyale elyalimanyi lyambone lyapaligwa kamula, atenda mabaja.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kelebuya nhwalo gu uloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpenikiyanga oti manuloi manhwamine! Ng'utange nukokaleka gambu gu kulaga okumpakupata. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Uloi gwinu ubolite, na ngobo inu ileligwe nu umea. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Jaabu jinu nu uloi gwinu uleligwa na nguu, na nguu jenie jibakube uchaili kwinu mangweto na jenie jiba kulye mibele jinu andi mwoto. Mangweto mikilundaki uloi mumachoba gukujomolela gano. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Malepangiteje mapungu gabe abakamulinga maengo mumigonda jinu. Mpenekie kokaleka kwabe! Nguto ja benia abaunanga mumigonda jinu kiike ka Angwana bina uwecho. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ntamangite padunia kukikonjalela nu ukonji. Nnenepinge mmi tela ni lichoba li kuchinjigwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Munhukumwile nu kunkoma mundu jwanga malemwa, jwanga nkananga mangweto.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubalakia nu kung'ongale Nnoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lele makalongo, mmegange mukulendela mpaka Angwana pabapakuika. Nnolanga nnemi apalende ipandwa yakwe mpaka pipakujela kwambone. Jwenio kulende ku kuimbalila ula ja chembeya na jantolo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Namangweto uyo mpaligwa kuimbalila nu kujema ndii, gambu lichoba likuika Angwana libandakile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Makalongo makang'olelanaje mmene makangweto jika Nnoongo manhwukumulanga. Nno, hakimu ambaika kuhukumula. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Makalongo anda mpai kukilandanaki kuimbalila mu kupotekigwa, maachanga akalondoli abatangacha nhwalo kuboka ka Angwana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Angweto takemanga mbaya magambu gukuimbalila. Nnyoine nhwalo gwa Ayubu, nu mmanyangite Angwana pabantendile pukujomolela. Gambu Angwana batweli kia nu upeele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Muno mwa genia, makalongo, mikijilapalije mbengu, wala dunia, wala kukilebe chachoa. Nnenganga “Elo,” anda kweli, nnenganga “Ije” anda uwangi na penia nhukumigwaje na Nnoongo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bo, abi mundu kati jinu juna malola? Apaligwa kugongalela ku Nnoongo. Bo, abile ojwaala mwojo? Apaligwa kujemba miambo ji kunnumba Nnoongo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bo, abi mundu ntamwe kati jinu? Apaligwa kakema akinanhota bikikuta cha bandu abunhwamine Kilisto, bombe mabunnyopela nu kumpakaya mauta kulina lya Angwana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kujopa kwenio anda bajopite ku imani ntamwe malama, Angwana mabannyinula jwenio. Ati ikabi akweti mabaja malekekeigwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yene nnengalane mabaja ginu na nnyopelane ku Nnoongo kupala nnamange. Kujopa kumundu jwajekatiligwe na Nnoongo kukweti makakala gukutenda majingi anda ajopite kukachana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nnondoli jwa Nnoongo Eliya akiba mundu andi twenga. Ngajopa kukachana ula jikakomaje, na ula jikomitije pikilambo kukingobu cha yaka itatu na myei sita. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuboka penia ngajopa kabele, mbengu ngijipia ula ni ipandwa ngimalika pannema.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Makalongo bango, kati jinu anda mundu ajilekite ndela ja kweli, na jonge ammuye, <verse number="20" style="v"/>mmanyanga kutenda jwenio ojwammuite abakunkola bwomi gwa mundu mmaja jwenio mukiu, na mabaja majingi gabakuboigwa.</para>
</usx>
